To enable the inbuilt Material UI DataGrid filter exclusively for the **Batch ID** and **VID** columns, we need to do three things:
 1. Enable the column menus and filtering for those specific columns.
 2. Explicitly disable filtering for all other columns so they don't clutter the inbuilt filter menu.
 3. Add the inbuilt GridToolbar so the "Filter" button appears at the top of the grid.
Here are the exact replacements for **VoucherPostingStatus.js**:
### 1. Update your Imports
Add GridToolbar to your existing @mui/x-data-grid import at the top of the file.
**Replace this:**
```javascript
import { DataGrid } from "@mui/x-data-grid";

```
**With this:**
```javascript
import { DataGrid, GridToolbar } from "@mui/x-data-grid";

```
### 2. Update the Columns Array
We will turn the menus and filters ON for batchId and vid, and explicitly turn them OFF for everything else.
